- limitations

17. IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURAL CONSTRAINT

Do NOT implement context ranking yet.

Do NOT implement optimize_context yet.

Do NOT implement the Claude Code plugin yet.

Do NOT implement Git intelligence yet.

Those belong to later phases.

Phase 2 should produce a high-quality repository intelligence layer that those future components can depend on.

